      "type": "music",
      "text": "Warm and gently funny evening music: guzheng and a light-hearted erhu over a soft plucked rhythm, a cheerful old man packing for exile and cracking jokes so his family will smile, tender with a playful wink, F major pentatonic, 78 bpm. Instrumental, no vocals.",
      "model": null,
